{"sha": "c3171972263597d8f1e3df5556a19410ad09452a1153055881365b7eccde8ac2", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:central-forces} 章 --- 中心力：行星与卫星}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:central-forces:1}", "$r = \\qty{6770}{km}$: $v = \\sqrt{GM/r} = \\qty{7.7}{km/s}$; $T = 2\\pi r/v", "= \\qty{5.5e3}{s} = \\qty{92}{min}$；$1440/92 \\approx 16$，即每天 16 次日出。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:central-forces:2}", "$r = (GMT^2/4\\pi^2)^{1/3} = (3.99\\times10^{14} \\times 7.42\\times10^9/39.5)^{1/3}", "= \\qty{4.22e7}{m}$：高度 \\qty{35800}{km}；$v = 2\\pi r/T = \\qty{3.1}{km/s}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:central-forces:3}", "$v_e = \\sqrt{2GM/R}$：地球 \\qty{11.2}{km/s}；月球 $\\sqrt{2 \\times 4.90\\times", "10^{12}/1.74\\times10^6} = \\qty{2.4}{km/s}$。气体分子在几百", "米每秒的分子，其速率分布在", "\\qty{2.4}{km/s} 以上仍有尾巴；经过地质时间，月球上的气体已逸散殆尽。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:central-forces:4}", "$T = a^{3/2}$（年，天文单位）：火星 \\qty{1.88}{yr}；木星 \\qty{11.9}{yr}；", "\\qty{30}{AU}：\\qty{164}{yr}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:central-forces:5}", "$\\Delta E = \\tfrac12 mv^2 + GMm(1/R - 1/r) = 2.94\\times10^{10} + 3.99\\times", "10^{17} \\times (1.570 - 1.477)\\times10^{-7} = 2.94\\times10^{10} + 0.37\\times", "10^{10} = \\qty{3.3e10}{J}$ --- \\qty{33}{MJ/kg}，即送入轨道每千克所需的能量，相当于 \\qty{0.7}{kg}", "汽油的能量（火箭所需远多于此，", "因为它们还须托起自身的燃料）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:central-forces:6}", "$a = (0.586 + 35.1)/2 = \\qty{17.8}{AU}$; $e = (35.1 - 0.586)/35.7 = 0.967$;", "$T = 17.8^{3/2} = \\qty{75}{yr}$。$v_p^2 = GM(2/r_p - 1/a)$，其中 $r_p =", "8.77\\times10^{10}$ m, $a = 2.67\\times10^{12}$ m: $v_p = \\qty{54}{km/s}$;", "$v_a = v_pr_p/r_a = \\qty{0.91}{km/s}$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:central-forces:7}", "$a = \\qty{24490}{km}$。$v_1 = \\qty{7.67}{km/s}$；在 $r_1$ 处的椭圆轨道上：", "$\\sqrt{GM(2/r_1 - 1/a)} = \\qty{10.07}{km/s}$: $\\Delta v_1 = \\qty{2.4}{km/s}$.", "在 $r_2$ 处：$\\sqrt{GM(2/r_2 - 1/a)} = \\qty{1.62}{km/s}$，圆轨道速率", "\\qty{3.07}{km/s}，$\\Delta v_2 = \\qty{1.45}{km/s}$。总计 \\qty{3.85}{km/s}；", "时长 $\\pi\\sqrt{a^3/GM} = \\qty{1.9e4}{s} = \\qty{5.3}{h}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:central-forces:8}", "$E_{p,\\mathrm{eff}}' = GMm/r^2 - L^2/mr^3 = 0$，得 $r_c = L^2/GMm^2$。", "$E_{p,\\mathrm{eff}}'' = -2GMm/r^3 + 3L^2/mr^4$；在 $r_c$ 处，$L^2 = GMm^2r_c$", "得 $E'' = GMm/r_c^3$，故 $\\omega_r^2 = E''/m = GM/r_c^3 = \\omega_{\\text{轨道}}^2$。", "小的径向扰动恰好每转一周振荡一次：轨道", "自行闭合 --- 是一个略微偏心的椭圆，而非玫瑰线。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:central-forces:9}", "只有引力同时作用于空间站与宇航员，二者沿同一轨道下落，", "因此二者之间无需接触力 --- 没有地板向上推，", "因此称为“失重”。$g = GM/r^2 = 3.99\\times10^{14}/(6.77\\times10^6)^2", "= \\qty{8.7}{m/s^2}$：引力几乎达到全强度；重力并未消失，", "它全部用于使运动轨迹弯曲。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:central-forces:10}", "$a = 4\\pi^2r/T^2 = 39.5 \\times 3.84\\times10^8/(2.36\\times10^6)^2 =", "\\qty{2.7e-3}{m/s^2}$；$g(R/r)^2 = 9.81/60.3^2 = \\qty{2.7e-3}{m/s^2}$：", "使苹果下落的同一引力定律也维系着月球，只是按 $1/r^2$ 衰减。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:central-forces:11}", "$E_k = 2Ze^2/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r_{\\min}$: $r_{\\min} = 8.99\\times10^9 \\times 2 \\times 79", "\\times (1.60\\times10^{-19})^2/8.0\\times10^{-13} = \\qty{4.5e-14}{m} = \\qty{45}{fm}$,", "为原子核半径的六倍：$\\alpha$ 粒子在接触前即折返。", "若要达到 \\qty{7}{fm}：$E_k \\approx \\qty{32}{MeV}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:central-forces:12}", "$E_m = -GMm/2r$ 减小 $\\Rightarrow$ $r$ 减小 $\\Rightarrow$ $v =", "\\sqrt{GM/r}$ 增大。动能 $GMm/2r$ 增加 $\\abs{\\Delta E}$，", "而势能 $-GMm/r$ 减少 $2\\abs{\\Delta E}$：所释放的势能有一半", "转化为动能，另一半", "因阻力而以热量形式耗散。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:central-forces:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $T = \\qty{43082}{s}$: $r = (GMT^2/4\\pi^2)^{1/3} = (3.986\\times10^{14}", "\\times 1.856\\times10^9/39.48)^{1/3} = \\qty{2.656e7}{m}$；高度", "\\qty{20190}{km}。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $v = \\sqrt{GM/r} = \\qty{3.87}{km/s}$.", "", "\\textbf{3.} $a = v^2/r = GM/r^2 = \\qty{0.565}{m/s^2} = g(R/r)^2$，比地表弱", "十七倍 --- 但并非为零：卫星", "绕地球持续下落。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $E_m/m = -GM/2r = \\qty{-7.5}{MJ/kg}$; $E_k/m = \\qty{+7.5}{MJ/kg}$,", "$E_p/m = \\qty{-15.0}{MJ/kg}$.", "", "\\textbf{5.} 相对于恒星，地球每个恒星日自转一周", "（即轨道参考系）；两圈之后卫星回到", "同一地面点的上方：地面轨迹每个恒星日重复一次。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $\\sin\\beta = R/r = 0.240$：$\\beta = 13.9^\\circ$，一个", "宽 $28^\\circ$ 的圆盘。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 地球静止轨道 \\qty{42200}{km}：高 $1.59$ 倍；", "导航轨道低于它。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $GM(1/R - 1/2r) = 3.986\\times10^{14}(1.570\\times10^{-7} - 1.88\\times", "10^{-8}) = \\qty{5.5e7}{J/kg} = \\qty{55}{MJ/kg}$.", ""]}